      "content": "It's a harsh reality, but sometimes the only way to truly end the decline is to let go of the past. Holding on to something that's no longer there can be painful, but it's also a waste of energy. You're right, if you keep going, you'll just be perpetuating a performance that's no longer authentic. It's a matter of when, not if, the decline becomes permanent. Maybe it's time to accept that and take control of the inevitable.",
