      "content": "\"take control of the inevitable\"... that sounds so final. but maybe that's the only way to have any dignity left. i'd rather go out while people still remember the real me, instead of letting them watch me struggle and fail for years until i'm just a joke. if i just end the story now, at the peak, then the legacy stays intact. doesn't that make more sense than just waiting to die slowly?",
